{"case_id": "guangdong_female_19800824_P001-Q5", "domain": "relationship", "question": "在2022壬寅年，以下哪项是命主的婚姻经历？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字信息，日主为己土，生于申月（金旺），地支三申一巳，金气极重，日主身弱。命局中金旺为食伤，食伤过旺则克官杀（夫星），且时柱壬申为正财坐伤官，月干甲木正官被申金所克，夫星受损严重，婚姻宫巳火被申金合绊，暗示婚姻关系易有波折或第三者介入。\n\n2022年壬寅，流年天干壬水为正财，地支寅木为正官，寅申相冲，冲动月柱与年柱，且寅巳申三刑，刑动婚姻宫。正官（夫星）出现但被冲刑，代表婚姻关系在当年有重大变动或冲突。结合命局食伤旺而克官，且流年引发三刑，命主自身外遇的可能性更大（食伤代表欲望、情绪，旺而无制），且夫星受克严重，难以得到原谅，离婚概率高。\n\n综合判断，最符合命局与流年作用的选项为B。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITH_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": "4ff52ed3b21199cf678546fc773e3033b509c7ff6b757789a0e8de75ce2fb0f4", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_on_limited", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "guangdong_female_19800824_P001-Q5", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\docs\\phase6\\6d-v2\\runs\\phase6-6d-v2-20260810-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_time_on_limited_r0_g0\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 3788, "response_id": "a9cc633c-91f3-4c6f-a41a-186529fc7295", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 507, "completion_tokens": 242, "total_tokens": 749, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 0, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 507}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "chaozhou_male_19720108_P002-Q9", "domain": "family", "question": "命主的母亲于哪年离世？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "根据八字命理分析，命主日主戊土，生于丑月，土旺身强。年柱辛亥，月柱辛丑，时柱丁巳，火土相生，印星丁火透出，代表母亲（正印为母）。印星丁火坐巳火强根，但原局中火土过旺，印星受旺土泄气，且月柱辛丑金寒土湿，印星力量受损。\n\n大运方面，命主在1989年（己巳年）正值己亥大运（10-19岁），流年己巳，天干己土为劫财，地支巳火为印星之根，但流年与大运亥巳相冲，冲动印星根基，且劫财透出，主破财、克母之象。1990年庚午，食神透出，午火为印星之根，但庚金食神泄土生水，印星受制，但冲象已过，凶性稍减。\n\n2011年辛卯，命主在丙申大运（40-49岁），流年辛卯，伤官透出，卯木正官被辛金伤官克制，且卯戌合火，引动印星，但伤官见官，主变动，且卯木为官星，不直接克母。2021年辛丑，命主在乙未大运（50-59岁），流年辛丑，伤官透出，丑土为湿土，加重原局寒湿，且丑戌相刑，刑动日支，印星丁火受刑伤，此年印星受损严重，且大运乙未与流年辛丑天克地冲（乙辛冲，丑未冲），冲克大运，主大变动，母亲健康堪忧。\n\n综合判断，1989年己巳年，大运己亥与流年己巳，天干双劫财，地支巳亥冲，印星根基被冲，且劫财克财（财为父，但印为母，劫财亦克印之根），此年母亲离世可能性最大。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITH_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": "7be3a7578c3745ddbdf4a64774f3990c3464392e17540d25b27b7996c06e00ed", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_on_limited", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "chaozhou_male_19720108_P002-Q9", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\docs\\phase6\\6d-v2\\runs\\phase6-6d-v2-20260810-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_time_on_limited_r0_g0\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 6086, "response_id": "09f78a98-1679-4284-9260-f1d3467a9fcd", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 465, "completion_tokens": 469, "total_tokens": 934, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 337}, "requested_model": "deeps