{"case_id": "male_19611230_P003-Q11", "domain": "unknown", "question": "大约哪个时间段，运程最佳？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "D", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字：日主丁火，生于寒冬子月，地支丑、酉、丑，天干庚辛金重重，火气衰弱，为身弱之命。喜用神为木、火，忌金、水、土（土多晦火）。\n\n大运排布：\n- 27-36岁（1988-1997）丁酉运：丁火比肩帮身，但酉金为忌，运程一般。\n- 37-46岁（1998-2007）丙申运：丙火劫财帮身，但申金合子水，水势更旺，忌神强，运程不佳。\n- 47-56岁（2008-2017）乙未运：乙木偏印生火，未土为燥土，且未中藏丁火，木火相生，对身弱丁火有较大助益，此运为佳。\n- 57-66岁（2018-2027）甲午运：甲木正印生火，午火为日主强根，木火通明，此运更是身弱喜用齐来，为一生最佳运程。\n\n问题问“大约哪个时间段，运程最佳”，选项为：\nA. 23—32岁（对应丁酉运后期至丙申运初期，不佳）\nB. 33—42岁（丙申运，不佳）\nC. 43—52岁（乙未运，佳，但不如甲午）\nD. 53—62岁（甲午运，最佳）\n\n因此最佳为D。\n\n最终答案：D", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITHOUT_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": "ccc35a892bd55a08dff4f46f8cfe7aae61028304110bfee39e4cdf0455e6f904", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_on_limited", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "male_19611230_P003-Q11", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\docs\\phase6\\6d-v2\\runs\\phase6-6d-v2-20260810-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_time_on_limited_r0_g0\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 3608, "response_id": "0ab982eb-3053-4cb0-94de-b4e697f2dc6e", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 408, "completion_tokens": 343, "total_tokens": 751, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 384}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 384, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 24}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "male_19611230_P003-Q12", "domain": "relationship", "question": "何时结婚？", "expected_answer": "A", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据八字命理分析，此命主日主丁火，生于子月（冬季），水旺火弱，全局金水偏重，火势衰微。年柱、时柱均为辛丑，月柱庚子，日支酉金，形成金水相生之势，财星（金）极旺，而日主丁火无根，仅靠时支丑中藏丁火微根，身弱明显。\n\n婚姻方面，男命以财星为妻星，此命正财庚金透于月干，偏财辛金双透年时，财星极旺且多现，但日主身弱，难以担财，故婚姻缘分虽多，却不易稳定或早成。大运来看，早年己亥、戊戌运（7-26岁）食伤生财，但身弱财旺，感情机会多却难落实；27岁后丁酉、丙申运（27-46岁）比劫帮身，但地支金旺，仍属财多身弱，婚姻压力大。\n\n关键在47岁后乙未大运（2008年起），未土为木库，能合绊子水，且乙木偏印生身，日主得助，此时财星有制，婚姻宫（日支酉）受未土冲动（酉未相冲），有婚动之象。但此运开始于47岁，故婚姻应在47岁之后，即43-52岁区间内。\n\n综合判断，命主身弱财旺，早年难成，中年后大运助身，方有婚缘，故最可能结婚年龄在43-52岁。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITHOUT_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": "ccc35a892bd55a08dff4f46f8cfe7aae61028304110bfee39e4cdf0455e6f904", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_on_limited", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "male_19611230_P003-Q12", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\docs\\phase6\\6d-v2\\runs\\phase6-6d-v2-20260810-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_time_on_limited_r0_g0\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 4773, "response_id": "af359359-0cc5-4b32-afe2-b4d0ae7e3452", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 401, "completion_tokens": 360, "total_tokens": 761, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 384}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 384, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 17}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "male_19611230_P003-Q13", "domain": "career", "question": "有官非刑事出现的时间？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字信息，日主丁火生于子月，水旺火弱，全局金水势力强盛，丁火身弱无疑。年柱、时柱均为辛丑，月柱庚子，金水成势，官杀（水）极旺，且天干透出庚金正财、辛金偏财，财生官杀，官杀攻身，命局带有明显的官非、刑狱信息。\n\n大运方面，命主7岁起运，依次为：\n- 己亥（7-16岁）\n- 戊戌（17-26岁）\n- 丁酉（27-36岁）\n- 丙申（37-46岁）\n- 乙未（47-56岁）\n\n问题问“有官非刑事出现的时间”，需结合大运流年引动官杀（水）或财生杀，且日主无救应之时。\n\n- 13-22岁（约1974-1983年）：此阶段在戊戌大运（17-26岁），戊土伤官透出，伤官见官（子水七杀），但戊土可制水，且戌为火库，有一定制化，官非可能性较低。\n- 23-32岁（约1984-1993年）：此阶段仍在戊戌大运后期及丁酉大运（27-36岁）前期。丁酉运，丁火比肩帮身，酉金为偏财，财生杀，但比肩可助身，官非风险中等。\n- 33-42岁（约1994-2003年）：此阶段在丁酉大运后期及丙申大运（37-46岁）前期。丙申运，丙火劫财帮身，但申金为正财，申子半合水局，财官杀更旺，且申金与命局子水、丑土会成水局之势，官杀攻身极重，此运中极易引发官非刑事。\n- 43-53岁（约2004-2013年）：此阶段在丙申大运后期及乙未大运（47-56岁）前期。乙未运，乙木偏印生身，未土为食神制杀，有一定缓解，官非风险降低。\n\n综合来看，33-42岁正值丙申大运，申子合水，官杀力量达到顶峰，且丙火劫财无力抗杀，最易有官非刑事。因此答案选C。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 0.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITHOUT_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": "ccc35a892bd55a08dff4f46f8cfe7aae61028304110bfee39e4cdf0455e6f904", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_on_limited", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "male_19611230_P003-Q13", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\docs\\phase6\\6d-v2\\runs\\phase6-6d-v2-20260810-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_time_on_limited_r0_g0\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 5666, "response_id": "ede2cc39-80c2-4828-aabc-d9dfb99cc916", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 407, "completion_tokens": 542, "total_tokens": 949, "prom