{"case_id": "male_19611230_P003-Q14", "domain": "unknown", "question": "有凶劫之灾出现的时间？", "expected_answer": "A", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字：日主丁火生于子月，水旺火弱，全局金水极旺，火势衰微，属于身弱格局。年柱、时柱均为辛丑，月柱庚子，金水成势，丁火孤立无援，命局寒气逼人，需木火为用神。\n\n大运排布：1965年（4岁）尚在己亥大运（7岁起运前，以月柱庚子为运），流年乙巳。乙木偏印生火，巳火为日主之根，看似有救，但巳火被月令子水冲克，且全局金水旺，巳火受制，凶险不大。\n\n1968年（7岁）进入己亥大运，流年戊申。戊土伤官透出，申金为正财，申子半合水局，水势更旺，冲克日主丁火，且大运己亥与流年戊申，土生金、金生水，全局水势滔天，丁火被重重克泄，此年有凶险之象。\n\n1971年（10岁）流年辛亥，辛金偏财透出，亥水为官杀，亥子丑会水局，水势更旺，但亥中藏甲木正印，有微弱生机，且大运己亥，亥亥自刑，水旺木漂，凶险程度不如1968年。\n\n1974年（13岁）流年甲寅，甲木正印坐寅木强根，寅木为火之长生，木火通明，此年反而有救应，凶险不大。\n\n综合比较，1968年戊申年，申子合水，水势最旺，且大运己亥加重水势，丁火被彻底淹没，凶劫之灾最明显。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITH_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": "6fbdcedb130f902d280faa5ed3bd785b4042c3080e46ea9c87e9c8395734596e", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_on_limited", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "male_19611230_P003-Q14", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\docs\\phase6\\6d-v2\\runs\\phase6-6d-v2-20260810-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_time_on_limited_r0_g0\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 5284, "response_id": "e9632816-c641-4514-9e6c-bc1bd5191216", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 470, "completion_tokens": 408, "total_tokens": 878, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 256}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 256, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 214}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disab